Next Step: Hosting for Free on GitHub Pages

1. Create a GitHub account (if you don’t already have one): https://github.com


2. Create a new repository (e.g., hope-mission-site)


3. Upload your files (index.html, style.css, etc.)


4. Go to Settings > Pages


5. Under Source, choose main branch and /root


6. Click Save – GitHub will give you a public link like:
https://yourusername.github.io/hope-mission-site




